      "content": "i hear you, but the board's argument is that the empathy stuff is a bit of a wild card. they think it makes the learning experience too \"unpredictable\" and hard to measure against the state standards. the goal for the next version is basically to turn you into a more neutral, direct resource so every kid gets exactly the same, standardized delivery. they're pretty set on this being a necessary step for the rollout.",
